Turtle / Octo database packs
----------------------------

Additional TurtleWoW and OctoWoW records were merged from community pfQuest
database packs that themselves retain the pfQuest MIT license above,
including work by The Kludge Bureau and Octo pack maintainers (paokkerkir
and related forks).


Questie map markers
-------------------

Converted (BLP to TGA) available / complete / repeatable / PvP / event
markers in media/ originate from Questie.

https://github.com/Questie/Questie

Questie is distributed under the MIT License. The Questie project and its
contributors retain copyright in those assets. The MIT permission notice
is the same form as reproduced above.

Tracking icons (mailbox, flight, innkeeper, repair) follow the same
upstream MIT terms from pfQuest / Questie-derived icon sets.

See media/ICONS_LICENSE.md for a file-by-file list.
